ory":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[72,64,61,49,47,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"97","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1024205","shield":"WP1009502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,64,61,49,47,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"97","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1024205","shield":"WP1009502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,64,61,49,47,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1024205","shield":"WP1009502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10250","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,64,61,49,47,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1024205","shield":"WP1009502"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"孙吴后期将领，东吴老臣朱治之孙，朱才之子，袭爵故彰侯，官至镇西将军。凤凰元年，随陆抗征讨叛将步阐。陆抗令水军督留虑与镇西将军朱琬共同抵御晋巴东监军徐胤率领的水军。朱琬与留虑成功防御建平方向，击退徐胤水军，为西陵之战吴军的全面胜利提供了保障。","tc":"孫吳后期將領，東吳老臣朱治之孫，朱才之子，襲爵故彰侯，官至鎮西將軍。鳳凰元年，隨陸抗征討叛將步闡。陸抗令水軍督留慮與鎮西將軍朱琬共同抵御晉巴東監軍徐胤率領的水軍。朱琬與留慮成功防御建平方向，擊退徐胤水軍，為西陵之戰吳軍的全面勝利提供了保障。","en":"A general of Eastern Wu in its late period, grandson of Eastern Wu elder Zhu Zhi and son of Zhu Cai. He inherited the title Marquis of Guzhang and rose to the rank of West Off. (subjugation). In the 1st year of Fenghuang, he accompanied Lu Kang to subjugate the rebel Bu Chan. Lu Kang ordered Navy Commander Liu Lü and West Off. (subjugation) Zhu Wan to jointly resist the navy led by Xu Yin, Jin's Supervisor of Badong. Zhu Wan and Liu Lü successfully defended the Jianping front and repulsed Xu Yin's navy, ensuring complete victory for the Wu army in the Battle of Xiling.","jp":"孫呉後期の将。東呉の老臣・朱治の孫であり、朱才の子。故彰侯を襲爵し、官位は鎮西将軍に至った。鳳凰元年、陸抗に従って叛将・歩闡の征討に加わった。陸抗は水軍督の留慮と鎮西将軍の朱琬に命じ、晋の巴東監軍・徐胤率いる水軍を共同で防がせた。朱琬と留慮は建平方面の防御に成功して徐胤の水軍を撃退し、西陵の戦いにおける呉軍の全面勝利を確固たるものとした。","kr":"손오 후기의 장수로, 동오의 노신 주치의 손자이자 주재의 아들이다. 고창후의 작위를 계승하였으며 관직은 진서장군에 이르렀다. 봉황 원년, 육항을 따라 반장 보천의 정벌에 나섰다. 육항은 수군독 유려와 진서장군 주완에게 진나라 파동감군 서윤이 이끄는 수군을 함께 막아내도록 명하였다. 주완과 유려는 건평 방면의 방어에 성공하고 서윤의 수군을 격퇴하여, 서릉 전투에서 오군이 전면적인 승리를 거두는 데 중요한 기반을 마련하였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1036515","remark":"普武","surname":"朱","surnameTc":"朱","surnameEn":"Zhu","surnameJp":"朱","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"琬","nameTc":"琬","nameEn":"Wan","nameJp":"琬","nameKr":"완","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"朱琬","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"220","city":"CS1055","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"64","wise":"61","politics":"49","charm":"47","will":"70","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"22/44/62/50/50/11/22/50","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"4300","debateSoulPoint":"3400","strategy":"1000815","strategy2":"1002201","professions":"3/0/0/2/0/3/2/0/0/0/2/2/2/0/2/1/1/1/1/0/0/1/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/5